      panel.innerHTML=`<section class="ingestion-card"><div class="ingestion-card-head"><div><h3>${esc(item.brand_name||'未知品牌')} · 异常处理建议</h3><p>任务 #${item.job_id||'—'} · 第 ${item.attempt_no||1} 次尝试 · ${badge(state)}</p></div><button data-action="back-recovery">返回工作台</button></div><div class="ingestion-recovery-timeline"><article><span>1</span><div><strong>发生了什么</strong><p>${esc(copy.problem)}</p></div></article><article><span>2</span><div><strong>AI 怎么判断</strong><p>${esc(copy.assessment)}</p></div></article><article><span>3</span><div><strong>AI 建议怎么试</strong><p>${esc(copy.suggestion)}</p></div></article><article><span>4</span><div><strong>安全说明</strong><p>${esc(copy.safety)}</p></div></article><article><span>5</span><div><strong>怎样算成功</strong><p>${esc(copy.success)}</p></div></article></div>${outcome?`<div class="ingestion-note ${state==='resumed'?'':'warn'}"><strong>处理结果</strong><br>${esc(outcome)}</div>`:''}<div class="ingestion-review-bar"><div><strong>当前下一步</strong><p>${esc(labels[state]||state)}。${item.review_decision?`你已选择“${esc(recoveryFeedbackText(item))}”。`:''}</p></div>${controls}</div><details class="ingestion-technical"><summary>专业信息（一般无需查看）</summary><div class="ingestion-note"><strong>技术状态</strong><br>失败代码：${esc(failureType)} · 处理层级：${esc(recoveryLayer(failureType))} · 系统风险级别：${esc(riskLabels[item.risk_level]||item.risk_level||'低风险')} · 下一动作：${esc(item.next_action||'')}</div>${actions.length?`<div class="ingestion-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>#</th><th>受控动作</th><th>用途</th><th>网络</th><th>证据引用</th></tr></thead><tbody>${actions.map((action,index)=>`<tr><td>${index+1}</td><td><strong>${esc(actionLabels[action.type]||action.type)}</strong><span class="ingestion-code">${esc(action.action_id)}</span></td><td>${esc(action.purpose||'本地解析')}</td><td>${action.network?'是':'否'}</td><td>${esc((action.evidence_refs||[]).join(', '))}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div>`:''}<div class="ingestion-detail-grid"><section><h4>证据与就绪检查</h4><pre>${pretty({evidence_pack:pack,readiness:item.readiness,evidence_request:item.evidence_request})}</pre></section><section><h4>AI 策略与安全计划</h4><pre>${pretty({strategy,plan})}</pre></section></div><section><h4>审计事件</h4><pre>${pretty(item.events||[])}</pre></section></details></section>`;
